# Systemcraft private brain (2026-08-22, build map GitHub #142) — the studio's
# machinery (bench, skill scaffold, templates, README) is tracked publicly;
# its corpus (free-canon distillates + book-to-skill ingests, derivative of
# licensed sources) and decision ledger (real product and eventually
# employer-confidential designs) are local-only. Never `git add` these;
# book-derived text never lands in tracked files.
systemcraft/corpus/
systemcraft/ledger/
